<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Usiminas Q1 net 70.2 mln reais. [corrected 19:15 gmt]</title>
<headline>Brazil Usiminas Q1 net 70.2 mln reais. [corrected 19:15 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian steelmaker Usiminas issued the following statement on its first quarter results.</p>
<p>    Net profit	 70.2 million</p>
<p>    Net revs	  421.5 million</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement its earnings were up (corrects from &quot;down&quot;) 6.2 percent from a year earlier, while its revenues were up 16 percent.</p>
<p>The company sold 690,000 tonnes of steel in the domestic market, it added.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
</text>
